{"id":"025904fb02a2295f","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence.md","title":"Rewriting Equals Semigroup Consequence","display":"thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence — Rewriting Equals Semigroup Consequence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence","aliases":["68-thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence"],"display":"thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence — Rewriting Equals Semigroup Consequence","depends_on":["[[68-df-presented-word-semigroup]]","[[68-df-semigroup-word-consequence]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 p.32 / PDF 41, unnumbered Post–Markov correspondence argument","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-expansion-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence — Rewriting Equals Semigroup Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a6560d8fe6fe304\" href=\"?note=4a6560d8fe6fe304\" title=\"68-df-presented-word-semigroup\">68-df-presented-word-semigroup</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83b2898ee4390d1\" href=\"?note=d83b2898ee4390d1\" title=\"68-df-semigroup-word-consequence\">68-df-semigroup-word-consequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 p.32 / PDF 41, unnumbered Post–Markov correspondence argument"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-expansion-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=W\">\\(R=W\\)</span>，但其有序对在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}\\)</span> 中解释为等式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]_{\\Omega,W}\">\\([X]_{\\Omega,W}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{68}\">\\(M_{68}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a6560d8fe6fe304\" href=\"?note=4a6560d8fe6fe304\" title=\"68-df-presented-word-semigroup\">68-df-presented-word-semigroup</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d83b2898ee4390d1\" href=\"?note=d83b2898ee4390d1\" title=\"68-df-semigroup-word-consequence\">68-df-semigroup-word-consequence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M_{68}(\\Omega,W))\\land\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M_{68}(\\Omega,W)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M_{68}(\\Omega,W))\\land\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M_{68}(\\Omega,W)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M_{68}(\\Omega,W),Z)=[Z]_{\\Omega,W}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M_{68}(\\Omega,W),Z)=[Z]_{\\Omega,W}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}(\\Omega,R,X,Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}(\\Omega,R,X,Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 p.32 / PDF p.41 的未编号论证。正向：每次上下文替换在任何满足 R 的 Ω-semigroup 中保持求值；有限步归纳给后承。反向：上游构造的词商满足 R，且逐字归纳使词 Z 的求值等于 [Z]。若后承成立，该模型中 [X]=[Y]；自反性使 Y∈[Y]，故 Y∈[X]，即 X 可达 Y。原书只对其特定对称过程叙述，证明仅用对称性与有限过程条件，因而这里提取为任意同类过程的对应定理。已核对原书证明，扩展参数适用性亦逐项核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-presented-word-semigroup","status":"resolved","id":"4a6560d8fe6fe304","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-presented-word-semigroup]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-semigroup-word-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"d83b2898ee4390d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-semigroup-word-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-presented-word-semigroup","status":"resolved","id":"4a6560d8fe6fe304","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","head